{
  "$comment": "Gates for scripts/field-test.mjs --storybook <name>. knownVariable: stories that may differ across passes (every other difference fails the job). allowedErrors: stories that may error. maxWallSeconds: ceiling per pass. concurrency: jux capture workers (a CI runner is much slower than a laptop). Seeded from the macOS 0.13.0 scorecard; Linux CI can differ (fonts, timing), so adjust after a CI run. See docs/field-tests.md.",
